 "remarks": "Charming Cape Cod in a Prime Norwalk Location!  Welcome to 150 Scribner Avenue, a beautifully refreshed 3-bedroom, 2-bath Cape offering the perfect combination of classic charm, modern updates, and convenience. This home features a brand-new roof and siding, along with a completely remodeled upper level, providing a fresh, move-in-ready feel. The main level has been refreshed with beautifully refinished hardwood floors, bringing warmth and character throughout. An attached one-car garage adds everyday convenience.  The best part? Much of the heavy lifting has already been done! With major exterior updates, a beautifully renovated upper level, and refinished floors, the opportunity is there to make the kitchen your own and create the heart of the home exactly how you envision it. This home also presents a great option for folks seeking multi generational living with an upper bedroom suite with a kitchenette, creating 2 distinct living spaces. Enjoy an unbeatable location with easy access to grocery stores, shopping, I-95, The SoNo Collection, and the vibrant restaurants and nightlife of Downtown SoNo. When it's time to unwind, Calf Pasture Beach is just a short trip away. A fantastic opportunity to own a beautifully updated home in a desirable Norwalk location, with the chance to add your own personal touch!",
